      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Enc - Wizard 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: Past the village you run into a familiar face.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: Tis I, Billius Ronaldorico Bleatario. I have come to challenge you all,
        but I am far stronger than last you saw me!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: Now that you mention it, this guy stinks a lot like cheese, meow! Perhaps
        he is the thief!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: "He does smell pretty bad... But that might just be because he\u2019s
        a goat. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: A simple cheese thief, I? I think not! Avast, and face me at my worst
        puny mortals!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 951e0b6242b07e746a6494341f74afc9,
